  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Monocot stem"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "A monocot stem has a sclerenchymatous hypodermis and a large number of scattered vascular bundles, each surrounded by a sclerenchymatous bundle sheath, in a large parenchymatous ground tissue. The bundles are conjoint and closed; peripheral bundles are generally smaller than central ones. Phloem parenchyma is absent, and water-containing cavities are present within the bundles.",
    "kn": "ಏಕದಳ ಕಾಂಡದಲ್ಲಿ ಸ್ಕ್ಲೀರೆಂಕೈಮಾ ಅಧಶ್ಚರ್ಮ ಮತ್ತು ಚದುರಿದ ನಾಳಪುಂಜಗಳು; ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದಕ್ಕೂ ಸ್ಕ್ಲೀರೆಂಕೈಮಾ ಕವಚ. ಪುಂಜಗಳು ಸಂಯುಕ್ತ ಮತ್ತು ಮುಚ್ಚಿದವು; ಅನ್ನನಾಳ ಪ್ಯಾರೆಂಕೈಮಾ ಇಲ್ಲ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Scattered bundles with sclerenchymatous sheath"
    },
    {
     "en": "Conjoint, closed"
    },
    {
     "en": "No phloem parenchyma; water cavities"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "A monocot stem has a sclerenchymatous hypodermis and a large number of scattered vascular bundles, each surrounded by a sclerenchymatous bundle sheath, in a large parenchymatous ground tissue. The bundles are conjoint and closed; peripheral bundles are generally smaller than central ones. Phloem parenchyma is absent, and water-containing cavities are present within the bundles.",
    "kn": "ಏಕದಳ ಕಾಂಡದಲ್ಲಿ ಸ್ಕ್ಲೀರೆಂಕೈಮಾ ಅಧಶ್ಚರ್ಮ ಮತ್ತು ಚದುರಿದ ನಾಳಪುಂಜಗಳು; ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದಕ್ಕೂ ಸ್ಕ್ಲೀರೆಂಕೈಮಾ ಕವಚ. ಪುಂಜಗಳು ಸಂಯುಕ್ತ ಮತ್ತು ಮುಚ್ಚಿದವು; ಅನ್ನನಾಳ ಪ್ಯಾರೆಂಕೈಮಾ ಇಲ್ಲ."
   }
